WEBVTT

00:19.394 --> 00:20.895
I'm ready now.

00:20.979 --> 00:23.898
I can bring down this building anytime.

00:25.900 --> 00:28.653
I still have a lot of magic left.

00:28.737 --> 00:32.282
<c.bg_transparent><i>At this rate, I can step in for Laios
and the others if anything happens.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:33.908 --> 00:36.077
This plan is good, right?

00:36.911 --> 00:39.748
I use up all my magic to stun the dragon.

00:40.415 --> 00:42.917
<c.bg_transparent><i>Instead of using chancy explosive spells
against the dragon</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:43.001 --> 00:44.878
at the risk of everyone's lives,

00:44.961 --> 00:47.756
<c.bg_transparent><i>it's more reliable to bury the dragon
in the debris of a building.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:49.132 --> 00:50.675
Yes, this is definitely a better plan.

00:51.926 --> 00:53.219
Stay calm.

00:56.765 --> 00:59.434
I need to focus on my task.

01:00.810 --> 01:02.520
We'll make this work!

01:03.313 --> 01:05.315
Hang in there, Falin!

02:29.691 --> 02:33.903
DELICIOUS IN DUNGEON

03:03.016 --> 03:04.017
It noticed us.

03:04.100 --> 03:05.143
Run!

03:09.689 --> 03:11.274
It's so fast!

03:11.357 --> 03:14.569
Just so you know, a Red Dragon's
maximum speed is 60 kilometers per hour!

03:14.652 --> 03:15.904
You should've said that earlier!

03:16.487 --> 03:18.239
The terrain is slowing it down!
It's all good!

03:18.948 --> 03:20.575
Turn right at the next corner!

03:27.373 --> 03:29.876
We'll lure it to unleash its fire breath
on this straight path.

03:30.877 --> 03:32.295
Dragons breathe fire

03:32.378 --> 03:35.048
<c.bg_transparent><i>by clicking their tongues
to ignite the fuel stored in their bodies.</i></c.bg_transparent>

03:35.131 --> 03:37.300
<c.bg_transparent><i>To prevent it from lashing out
when we restrain it,</i></c.bg_transparent>

03:37.383 --> 03:40.053
<c.bg_transparent><i>we'll make it use up
all its fuel along the way!</i></c.bg_transparent>

03:42.013 --> 03:43.306
It's clicking its tongue!

03:44.015 --> 03:45.266
Here comes!

03:48.853 --> 03:50.897
What intense heat!

03:50.980 --> 03:52.065
But…

03:58.154 --> 04:00.573
<c.bg_transparent><i>Thanks to this pot and magic,
we can endure it.</i></c.bg_transparent>

04:01.157 --> 04:02.992
Good. So far, so…

04:05.161 --> 04:06.246
What?

04:07.288 --> 04:11.292
<c.bg_transparent><i>The heat of the pot
is spreading evenly and…</i></c.bg_transparent>

04:12.168 --> 04:13.294
So hot!

04:22.679 --> 04:25.098
But of course, it's hot!

04:25.181 --> 04:28.017
Senshi uses it for cooking every day!

04:28.101 --> 04:30.853
Somehow, I thought it would have
a special resistance to dragon fire.

04:30.937 --> 04:32.063
I thought Namari said

04:32.146 --> 04:35.858
that adamant protects
against all dragon attacks.

04:35.942 --> 04:38.194
She was just talking out of her hat!

04:38.278 --> 04:39.487
I never said that.

04:42.073 --> 04:43.950
Ugh, it's doing it again!

04:44.033 --> 04:45.034
We have no choice!

04:45.118 --> 04:46.411
We'll change our route!

04:53.251 --> 04:54.377
Huh?

04:55.003 --> 04:55.962
No way!

04:56.045 --> 04:57.463
They're here already?

04:57.547 --> 04:58.965
Aren't they a bit early?

05:00.008 --> 05:01.467
Wait, what?

05:01.551 --> 05:04.095
I thought the plan was to split in two!

05:04.178 --> 05:06.848
Can I go ahead and stick to the plan?

05:07.348 --> 05:08.808
Ugh, I don't understand!

05:08.891 --> 05:10.977
Fine! Here goes!

06:02.028 --> 06:03.404
No way!

06:03.488 --> 06:04.781
It's not hurt at all!

06:06.365 --> 06:07.200
Shh!

06:07.867 --> 06:09.118
Don't move.

06:18.795 --> 06:21.047
Its inverse scale is right there.

06:21.631 --> 06:24.342
A few more steps, and I could reach it!

06:34.560 --> 06:35.394
It…

06:36.521 --> 06:38.439
It ran away!

06:38.523 --> 06:39.857
Damn it, Kensuke!

06:39.941 --> 06:41.109
Never trust a monster…

06:41.984 --> 06:44.487
-You…
-Laios! Chilchuck! Get up!

06:45.029 --> 06:46.405
Above us!

06:47.406 --> 06:48.825
Hide under its belly!

06:48.908 --> 06:50.201
Laios, you bastard!

06:50.284 --> 06:52.078
My bad! I'm sorry!

06:52.161 --> 06:53.037
Dammit!

06:53.121 --> 06:55.498
The common language
doesn't have enough words of insult!

06:55.581 --> 06:56.958
Ponza! Toroldo!

06:57.041 --> 07:00.586
-
-I'm being insulted in a strange language!

07:00.670 --> 07:02.463
What are we gonna do now?

07:03.548 --> 07:05.591
It's angry! It's super angry!

07:05.675 --> 07:06.759
We have no choice.

07:06.843 --> 07:08.594
Let's run from the side of its tail--

07:11.681 --> 07:13.766
No, it's too dangerous.

07:13.850 --> 07:16.436
What if we never manage to escape
from under its crotch?

07:19.522 --> 07:21.023
This won't do!

07:21.107 --> 07:23.109
A simple incantation
won't have any effect on it.

07:23.192 --> 07:24.193
Focus!

07:33.953 --> 07:35.371
What did you do that for?!

07:35.455 --> 07:36.998
Our only weapon just got shattered!

07:37.832 --> 07:39.500
What do we do now?!

07:40.126 --> 07:41.335
We have no choice.

07:41.419 --> 07:42.545
Use this.

07:43.087 --> 07:43.963
What?

07:44.046 --> 07:47.258
Is that really made of a special metal?

07:47.341 --> 07:50.303
<c.bg_transparent><i>It slices through the bone
and skin of every monster.</i></c.bg_transparent>

07:50.386 --> 07:53.222
<c.bg_transparent><i>And I've diligently
taken care of it each day.</i></c.bg_transparent>

07:53.306 --> 07:55.266
<c.bg_transparent><i>There's probably
no other like it on this earth.</i></c.bg_transparent>

07:55.349 --> 07:57.768
It's a mithril cooking knife!

07:58.352 --> 07:59.604
Mithril?

07:59.687 --> 08:00.771
Are you serious?

08:01.355 --> 08:03.357
I wish Namari could've seen this.

08:03.441 --> 08:06.110
Depending on the situation,
she might've killed Senshi.

08:06.194 --> 08:09.447
I had a suspicion that she might,
which is why I chose to remain silent.

08:12.450 --> 08:13.784
Take this!

08:15.870 --> 08:17.914
It really pierced through its scale!

08:20.500 --> 08:23.794
<c.bg_transparent><i>But the blade is so short that no matter
where I strike,</i></c.bg_transparent>

08:23.878 --> 08:26.923
<c.bg_transparent><i>I might not be able
to deliver a fatal blow.</i></c.bg_transparent>

08:36.057 --> 08:38.059
What should I do now?

08:38.142 --> 08:40.436
This means the plan failed, right?

08:40.520 --> 08:43.022
Or are they executing
a different strategy?

08:43.606 --> 08:45.191
What am I supposed to do?

08:47.568 --> 08:49.695
No time to hesitate!

08:49.779 --> 08:51.697
Get back!

08:52.949 --> 08:55.284
<c.bg_transparent><i>My sword
is getting farther and farther away.</i></c.bg_transparent>

08:55.785 --> 08:58.704
If we continue retreating,
we'll end up in the open square.

08:58.788 --> 09:01.207
Then, we'll be turned to cinder
by its fire breath!

09:01.290 --> 09:03.709
I will draw its attention.

09:03.793 --> 09:05.336
Don't! It's too risky!

09:05.419 --> 09:08.464
Laios, you understand, don't you?

09:09.048 --> 09:11.926
Among all the monsters
you've eaten so far,

09:12.009 --> 09:14.470
was there one
that didn't give their utmost effort?

09:14.554 --> 09:17.431
In this place,
it's a matter of eat or be eaten.

09:17.515 --> 09:20.726
If we don't make desperate efforts,
we'll be the ones who'll be eaten.

09:21.227 --> 09:22.436
Brace yourself for the worst!

09:23.688 --> 09:24.730
Senshi!

09:36.576 --> 09:37.868
-Sen--
-Idiot!

09:37.952 --> 09:40.246
There's no point if you rush out!

09:40.830 --> 09:42.123
Retreat for now.

09:42.206 --> 09:44.125
Figure something out with Marcille!

09:44.709 --> 09:46.127
Hey! Are you still alive?

09:46.210 --> 09:47.628
I'll help you out now--

09:51.340 --> 09:52.592
Can you move?

10:05.271 --> 10:06.564
I did it!

10:12.612 --> 10:13.863
It's stuck to the ground.

10:13.946 --> 10:15.031
Move aside!

10:18.117 --> 10:19.493
Laios!

10:23.039 --> 10:24.290
I'll be right back!

10:25.916 --> 10:27.752
Senshi! Get up!

10:28.669 --> 10:29.587
Sen--

10:41.182 --> 10:42.308
Sorry, Marcille.

10:42.391 --> 10:44.060
I didn't expect to find you here.

10:44.143 --> 10:46.646
I'm glad my magic seems to be working.

10:47.146 --> 10:49.774
What's going on? Where are the other two?

10:49.857 --> 10:51.108
Things aren't looking good.

10:51.192 --> 10:53.444
Every strategy we came up with has failed.

10:53.527 --> 10:56.322
The other two are unconscious
at the dragon's feet.

10:56.405 --> 10:58.824
What?! W-What do we do?!

10:58.908 --> 11:01.786
Right, the only option is to use my magic.

11:01.869 --> 11:04.205
The dragon is injured and agitated.

11:04.288 --> 11:06.540
It's risky to approach it
or enter its line of sight.

11:06.624 --> 11:08.959
But we have to do something quickly!

11:09.543 --> 11:11.128
-Let's head upstairs.
-What?

11:12.171 --> 11:13.255
W-What will you do?

11:13.339 --> 11:15.216
I'll climb to the height
of the dragon's head.

11:15.299 --> 11:17.218
-And stand inside the pot.
-What?

11:17.301 --> 11:19.929
Then, I want you to blow it up.

11:20.554 --> 11:22.973
What? Seriously?

11:23.057 --> 11:25.476
The dragon is blind in its left eye.

11:25.559 --> 11:27.103
If I approach from its left side,

11:27.186 --> 11:29.939
I should be able to leap onto it
without being noticed.

11:30.439 --> 11:32.108
But…

11:32.691 --> 11:35.027
You did a similar maneuver before…

11:35.653 --> 11:37.822
when you fought the Undine.

11:37.905 --> 11:41.534
But that was on the water with Water-Walk.

11:41.617 --> 11:44.078
This time,
we have defense magic and the pot.

11:44.161 --> 11:45.454
What happens next?

11:45.538 --> 11:48.416
How will you stab its inverse scale
while clinging to its head?

11:49.333 --> 11:51.335
I have an idea about that.

11:52.753 --> 11:54.630
There's no room for more failures.

11:55.673 --> 11:57.758
I don't plan on failing.

12:02.179 --> 12:04.014
Are you sure about this?

12:04.098 --> 12:06.016
You do have a plan, right?

12:06.934 --> 12:07.935
I believe in you.

12:38.048 --> 12:39.717
I'll be flung off.

12:39.800 --> 12:41.719
I need to execute my plan swiftly.

12:41.802 --> 12:43.971
It'll be over in an instant.

12:44.555 --> 12:46.348
It's not a big deal.

12:47.558 --> 12:49.059
Especially when compared…

12:50.102 --> 12:51.729
to Falin's pain!

12:54.690 --> 12:55.983
Laios!

14:01.298 --> 14:02.758
Laios!

14:03.551 --> 14:05.219
Where are you going?

14:05.302 --> 14:07.721
I heard there's a ghost at the graveyard.

14:07.805 --> 14:09.473
Don't tell Dad or anyone else, okay?

14:11.308 --> 14:12.560
-Whoopee!
-Whoopee!

14:17.815 --> 14:19.233
Don't worry.

14:19.316 --> 14:21.569
It's difficult to walk
with you clinging to me like that.

14:27.324 --> 14:29.493
There's not even a single bug.

14:29.577 --> 14:30.911
Let's head back, Falin.

14:33.497 --> 14:34.665
Laios…

14:41.881 --> 14:44.341
Laios!

14:48.345 --> 14:50.055
Take it off!

14:50.764 --> 14:52.558
Help me.

14:52.641 --> 14:54.810
-
-

14:54.894 --> 14:57.479
I can't breathe.

14:58.397 --> 15:00.816
Falin, run…

15:02.818 --> 15:04.653
Laios!

15:11.535 --> 15:12.661
Let my brother…

15:13.913 --> 15:15.456
go!

15:28.302 --> 15:30.179
It's someone who was buried in that grave.

15:31.180 --> 15:33.599
His ring is binding his soul.

15:34.183 --> 15:35.351
Remove it for him.

15:36.936 --> 15:38.812
And his soul will be set free.

15:39.688 --> 15:40.648
A ring?

15:41.315 --> 15:42.691
What are you talking about?

15:43.192 --> 15:46.487
This is the grave of Olman,
who passed away recently.

15:46.570 --> 15:50.866
When he was alive, he used to boast
about a golden ring he bought from an elf.

15:51.367 --> 15:53.911
How did that child know about it?

15:57.373 --> 15:59.708
Did I do something wrong?

16:00.209 --> 16:02.252
You're incredible, Falin.

16:02.336 --> 16:04.630
You have a knack for ghost magic.

16:05.381 --> 16:06.840
Don't let it bother you.

16:06.924 --> 16:09.009
Grown-ups are just scared of magic.

16:09.551 --> 16:12.388
You should study proper magic.

16:12.471 --> 16:14.098
You'll never be out of a job.

16:14.181 --> 16:15.557
What kind of job?

16:15.641 --> 16:16.558
Let's see.

16:16.642 --> 16:19.061
You could become a priest
or a grave keeper.

16:19.144 --> 16:21.563
Being a traveling exorcist
might be interesting, too.

16:23.983 --> 16:27.653
You travel to foreign countries,
helping people in need.

16:28.278 --> 16:29.488
That sounds fun.

16:29.571 --> 16:32.074
If I do that, will you come with me?

16:32.157 --> 16:33.283
Of course!

16:33.367 --> 16:34.827
What country do you want to visit?

16:37.037 --> 16:38.831
I'd love to see the sea.

16:39.373 --> 16:40.874
Or even a desert.

16:40.958 --> 16:43.627
They say there's a country
of talking dogs in the desert.

16:44.503 --> 16:46.296
I definitely want to go there!

16:47.214 --> 16:48.549
-
-

16:48.632 --> 16:52.428
<c.bg_transparent><i>maybe we shouldn't
travel together anymore.</i></c.bg_transparent>

16:53.012 --> 16:55.431
Falin, why not?

16:56.765 --> 16:58.392
You don't have to worry about me.

16:59.893 --> 17:02.855
Goodbye, Laios.

17:05.899 --> 17:07.776
Laios, are you okay?

17:08.402 --> 17:10.446
I stopped the bleeding for now.

17:10.529 --> 17:11.905
Just hold on a bit longer.

17:11.989 --> 17:14.867
I'll go look for the other two
and for your leg!

17:17.202 --> 17:19.830
"Don't worry about me"?

17:20.873 --> 17:23.375
Don't say sad stuff like that.

17:24.376 --> 17:27.212
I promise to bring you back.

17:27.838 --> 17:29.548
Hey!

17:30.132 --> 17:32.009
Chilchuck!

17:32.092 --> 17:33.844
Senshi!

17:35.304 --> 17:36.722
There you are!

17:37.264 --> 17:38.515
Thank goodness!

17:38.599 --> 17:39.933
Are you okay?

17:40.017 --> 17:41.060
Of course, not.

17:42.269 --> 17:45.564
I need to work on my defense magic more.

17:45.647 --> 17:49.193
At least we haven't suffered any ruptures,
so that's good enough.

17:49.276 --> 17:55.199
Tronsum Lunaae Stantinus Eurekant Oonzu.

17:56.033 --> 17:58.702
Ow!

17:59.536 --> 18:01.497
Isn't he in more pain now?

18:01.580 --> 18:04.958
When a serious injury is healed quickly,
you experience recovery pain.

18:05.042 --> 18:06.335
Don't worry!

18:06.418 --> 18:08.170
It's a sign that you've healed properly!

18:08.253 --> 18:09.505
It's your turn, Senshi.

18:09.588 --> 18:12.257
I'm fine. I'll heal on my own.

18:12.341 --> 18:13.801
It could take months.

18:13.884 --> 18:16.386
Falin was skilled at recovery magic,

18:16.470 --> 18:19.181
but I'm pretty confident
in my speed as well.

18:19.264 --> 18:22.226
T-That's the cause of the pain, isn't it?

18:22.309 --> 18:23.936
GAAAAAAH

18:24.019 --> 18:25.229
SNAP POP

18:25.813 --> 18:27.231
Laios!

18:27.314 --> 18:29.066
Come on, lift your leg.

18:33.570 --> 18:40.577
<c.bg_transparent><i>Britrayeums Lunae Actum
Asbam Histum Eres Eurekant Ounzu.</i></c.bg_transparent>

18:43.831 --> 18:45.499
It reattached!

18:47.835 --> 18:49.753
The inside of my leg feels itchy.

18:49.837 --> 18:51.755
It's recovery pain.

18:51.839 --> 18:54.258
Well done, Laios.

18:54.341 --> 18:57.511
You really defeated the Red Dragon.

18:57.594 --> 18:59.388
It's thanks to all of you.

18:59.471 --> 19:02.015
If any one of you weren't here,
we couldn't have won.

19:02.099 --> 19:04.768
For a moment,
I was afraid of what might happen.

19:04.852 --> 19:07.187
Even my blood froze.

19:07.271 --> 19:09.273
Our estimate was a little too naive.

19:09.857 --> 19:12.234
Well, we won, so that's all that matters.

19:12.734 --> 19:14.027
But…

19:14.111 --> 19:15.779
Here, Laios.

19:15.863 --> 19:16.864
Kensuke.

19:17.364 --> 19:20.033
I still haven't forgiven you for this yet.

19:20.617 --> 19:22.744
You owe me a long explanation.

19:22.828 --> 19:23.662
Right.

19:24.997 --> 19:28.292
Well then, let's look inside its stomach.

19:38.635 --> 19:39.928
What a thick skin.

19:40.012 --> 19:41.513
Fighting with this cooking knife,

19:41.597 --> 19:43.640
no wonder we couldn't even reach
its subcutaneous fat.

19:44.141 --> 19:47.477
But it's going to be a lot of work
getting to its stomach.

19:47.561 --> 19:49.438
I could try blasting it open.

19:49.521 --> 19:52.941
The insides of a dragon
are no different from any other creature.

19:53.025 --> 19:55.569
Let's slowly carve through its flesh.

20:04.161 --> 20:05.621
It's one of its ribs.

20:05.704 --> 20:07.956
Let's go around it and keep digging.

20:10.792 --> 20:13.295
It's dark. Should we light a lantern?

20:13.378 --> 20:14.588
No fire.

20:14.671 --> 20:16.256
Marcille, light.

20:26.808 --> 20:28.352
It's so hot.

20:28.435 --> 20:31.480
It reminds me
of when I used to work in a mine.

20:33.190 --> 20:34.733
What's this?

20:34.816 --> 20:36.318
It's the stomach!

20:39.655 --> 20:40.739
All right.

20:40.822 --> 20:42.241
Let's open it.

20:51.959 --> 20:53.502
It's empty.

20:54.169 --> 20:55.712
It can't be…

20:55.796 --> 20:58.006
Maybe we got the wrong dragon.

20:58.090 --> 20:59.383
That's impossible.

20:59.466 --> 21:03.011
The scar above its eye
confirms it's the same dragon.

21:04.596 --> 21:09.434
It's difficult to imagine there being
multiple territorial males in one area.

21:10.018 --> 21:12.187
Let's examine its intestines as well.

21:13.855 --> 21:16.984
N-Not even a fragment of a bone is left.

21:17.484 --> 21:20.195
We have to examine its droppings, too!

21:21.738 --> 21:24.741
Could its digestion have been sped up
by constant movement without sleep?

21:28.495 --> 21:29.621
I got it!

21:49.141 --> 21:50.934
What is this?

21:51.018 --> 21:53.437
A mass of hair and bone.

21:53.520 --> 21:55.647
Some creatures
that ingest their prey whole

21:55.731 --> 21:58.025
tend to regurgitate indigestible parts.

21:58.984 --> 22:02.696
But instead of doing that, Red Dragons
use them as fuel for their fire breath.

22:03.530 --> 22:06.783
These black hairs suggest
it consumed a few Wargs.

22:06.867 --> 22:07.951
And…

22:11.830 --> 22:13.457
H-Hair…

22:13.540 --> 22:14.833
Could it be…

22:14.916 --> 22:16.209
Let's sift through the mass.

22:16.793 --> 22:18.628
We might find human bones in it.

22:22.174 --> 22:24.593
Hey, isn't this staff…

22:26.178 --> 22:27.804
Hey, Laios!

22:27.888 --> 22:29.056
This staff!

22:34.061 --> 22:35.020
F…

22:36.313 --> 22:37.856
Falin?

24:07.821 --> 24:11.950
Subtitle translation by: Ai Matsuoka
